{
  "uid": "labkit-session",
  "title": "labkit session",
  "description": "omp's session detail: one trace's totals, its waterfall, its requests, tools and captured bodies. Source: scripts/observability/labkit-session-dashboard.json.",
  "tags": [
    "labkit"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "refresh": "1m",
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "labkit dashboards",
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "labkit"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "includeVars": true,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "service",
        "label": "Service",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "prometheus"
        },
        "query": {
          "query": "label_values(traces_spanmetrics_calls_total{service=~\"labkit-.*\"}, service)",
          "refId": "service"
        },
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": "labkit-.*",
        "multi": true,
        "current": {
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1
      },
      {
        "name": "trace",
        "label": "Trace ID",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "description": "The trace of a session or game: open it from the \"Sessions and games\" table of the labkit agent dashboard, or paste a trace ID."
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 6
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "One session or game, by its trace: **$trace**. Open it from the \"Sessions and games\" table of the [labkit agent](/d/labkit-agent/labkit-agent) dashboard, or paste a trace ID in the box above. The statistics read the spans of the dashboard's time range: widen it if the session is older.\n\nGrafana's trace view is a waterfall: one row per span, nested by parent. Unlike omp's session timeline it has no lanes per agent (the sessions of a game, or a subagent, are nested rows, not side-by-side lanes), no idle time (time in which no span of the trace ran is not measured or shown), no zoom or pan beyond narrowing the time axis with the minimap, no compressing of idle stretches, and no transcript of the messages: a span shows its attributes and log lines, and the text that was sent and received is in the captured bodies (the logs panel below, written at LABKIT_LOG_LEVEL=debug)."
      },
      "description": "How to choose the trace, and what Grafana's waterfall cannot show of omp's session timeline."
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Wall time",
      "description": "From the start to the end of the trace's root span (agent.session, or zork.game for a game): TraceQL max_over_time(duration) of the span with no parent.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "tempo",
        "uid": "tempo"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6,
        "w": 6,
        "h": 3
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "values": false,
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": ""
        },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "tempo",
            "uid": "tempo"
          },
          "queryType": "traceql",
          "query": "{trace:id=\"$trace\" && nestedSetParent < 0} | max_over_time(duration)",
          "metricsQueryType": "instant",
          "limit": 50
        }
      ]
    },
